// Decorative blocks go down with the block brush and are structural by their own numbers: two carved
// pillars at the third points save the 12 m rock roof that caves in without them (roof_needs_pillar.scn),
// like wood pillars do (pillars_rock_roof.scn). Planks, tiles and polished stone lay like any block.
